sorption laws.\n\n- Statement II is logically equivalent to $C.$ We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C∧(¬D∨C) & ≡C∧(C∨¬D) \\\\  & ≡C.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is logically equivalent to $C.$ We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(¬D∨C)∧C & ≡C∧(¬D∨C) \\\\  & ≡C∧(C∨¬D) \\\\  & ≡C.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186378223 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157275 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5d4ea352-2a82-5ff5-8c08-b7f9a09929e6" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Law that Disjunction Absorbs Conjunction"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75955220-3663-523d-9f9e-7f463108c24e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470685} {:answer/id #uuid "733ecdec-5955-5666-9935-d16529c69334" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470686}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "733ecdec-5955-5666-9935-d16529c69334" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470686} :answer-field/id #uuid "b36364da-4298-515b-b8fc-e6e228ebd6a1" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471848} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cefde8fb-24ba-5876-a3ce-72bfa21f1959" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470687} {:answer/id #uuid "6ad2f61e-57cc-5ca9-b390-865961a0e81c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470688}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ad2f61e-57cc-5ca9-b390-865961a0e81c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type